st move because:\n- It immediately secures my king's safety\n- It activates my h8 rook\n- It connects my rooks\n- Once my king is safe, I can focus on exploiting White's incredibly vulnerable king position on b4\n- This is a fundamental principle: secure your own king before attacking\n\nAnswer: K: e8-g8"}
