ely. Between e2-e1-q and e2-f1-q, I should check what's on f1. Looking at the board, f1 has a White bishop (BWF0). Capturing the bishop while promoting is strictly better than just promoting, as it removes one of White's pieces while gaining a queen. This gives me a massive material advantage (extra queen minus White's bishop).\n\nAnswer: P: e2-f1-q"}
