likely Ka1 or Ka3), I can continue to harass it with my superior forces. This maintains the initiative and keeps White's King under constant pressure. With such a material and positional advantage, forcing the opponent's King into the corner accelerates my winning chances.\n\nAnswer: N: d2-b3"}
