ins my rook's dominant position on the first rank. After the king moves, I can continue to harass it while my advanced pawns provide additional winning chances. Active piece play with forcing moves is key in rook endgames, and this check keeps maximum pressure on White's position.\n\nAnswer: R: e1-c1"}
