ward.\n\nReason: Capturing the Rook on g1 wins a full Rook, giving me an overwhelming material advantage (two Rooks vs none). While checking moves are tempting, they don't win material immediately, and White's King can escape. With two Rooks and a material advantage, I can easily convert this into a win. This is the most concrete and forcing continuation.\n\nAnswer: R: c1-g1"}
