ntrols the pawn and can capture it if needed, or at minimum prevent its advance. With White's king far away on h2 and the knight on h6, White cannot adequately defend this pawn. This move eliminates White's most dangerous asset and should lead to a winning endgame for Black with my extra material.\n\nAnswer: K: d6-c6"}
